          + 4. to go down, sink: lumubog
          + 5. to begin to move, start: magsimula, simulan, mag-umpisa,
            umpisahan
          + 6. to fix: magtakda, itakda

   adj.
     *
          + that has been set, fixed, arranged, formal: nakatakda,
            nakahanda, inihanda

   n.
     *
          + 1. group, things or people belonging together: pulutong,
            pangkat, magkakasama, huwego
          + 2. to set about, to begin, start work: magsimula, simulan,
